sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant LS as Llama Stack Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant Inline as RagasEvaluatorInline
    participant Dataset as DatasetIO API
    participant Inference as Inference API<br/>(LLM + Embeddings)
    participant Remote as RagasEvaluatorRemote
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KFPPod as KFP Pod<br/>(Pipeline Step)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Inference: Flow 1: Inline Evaluation
        Client->>LS: POST /eval/run<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP
        LS->>Inline: Dispatch evaluation<br/>(in-process Python API)
        Inline->>Dataset: Retrieve dataset rows<br/>(in-process API)
        Dataset-->>Inline: Dataset rows
        Inline->>Inference: LLM completions + embeddings<br/>(in-process API, max_workers=1)
        Inference-->>Inline: Ragas metric scores
        Inline-->>LS: Evaluation results (in-memory job store)
        Client->>LS: GET /eval/job/result<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP
        LS-->>Client: JSON results
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: Remote Evaluation (Kubeflow Pipelines)
        Client->>LS: POST /eval/run<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP
        LS->>Remote: Dispatch evaluation
        Remote->>KFP: Submit KFP pipeline<br/>HTTPS/443 Bearer token
        KFP-->>Remote: Pipeline run ID
        Remote-->>LS: Job ID (status: running)
        LS-->>Client: Job ID

        Note over KFPPod: Stage 1: Data Retrieval
        KFP->>KFPPod: Launch retrieve_data step
        KFPPod->>LS: Fetch dataset rows<br/>HTTP (configurable port)
        LS-->>KFPPod: Dataset rows

        Note over KFPPod: Stage 2: Ragas Evaluation
        KFP->>KFPPod: Launch run_ragas_evaluation step
        KFPPod->>LS: LLM completions + embeddings<br/>HTTP (configurable port)
        LS-->>KFPPod: Inference results
        KFPPod->>S3: Store evaluation results<br/>HTTPS/443 AWS IAM (K8s secret)

        Client->>LS: GET /eval/job/status<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP
        LS->>Remote: Check job status
        Remote->>KFP: Get pipeline run status<br/>HTTPS/443 Bearer token
        KFP-->>Remote: Status: completed

        Remote->>S3: Fetch results<br/>HTTPS/443 AWS IAM
        S3-->>Remote: Evaluation results
        Remote-->>LS: Results
        LS-->>Client: JSON results
    end
